#: ../../site/api/viz.md:10
msgid "Owning native self-contained HTML performance report builder."
msgstr "持有型原生自包含 HTML 绩效报告构建器。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:10
msgid ""
"Mirrors fincore.viz.html_backend.HtmlReportBuilder: title/heading/raw HTML "
"sections, stats tables, metric cards, cumulative-returns/drawdown/ rolling-"
"Sharpe tables and the monthly-returns pivot table. All chart values come "
"from precomputed native chart data; the builder never recomputes a financial"
" kernel. build() is deterministic and contains no external stylesheet, "
"script or image reference."
msgstr ""
"镜像 fincore.viz.html_backend.HtmlReportBuilder：标题/小标题/原始 HTML "
"小节、统计表、指标卡片、累积收益/回撤/滚动夏普比率表以及月度收益透视表。所有图表数值都来自预先计算的原生图表数据；构建器从不重新计算金融内核。build()"
" 是确定性的，且不包含任何外部样式表、脚本或图片引用。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:10
msgid "Appends an escaped level-1 title section."
msgstr "追加转义的 1 级标题小节。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:10
