#: ../../site/api/viz.md:16
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Supports one printf conversion — %[flags][width][.precision] followed by one"
" of f, e, g, d or i — plus %%. Invalid formats raise input_error instead of "
"Python's ValueError/TypeError."
msgstr ""
"支持一个 printf 转换——%[flags][width][.precision] 后接 f、e、g、d 或 i 之一——以及 %%。无效格式会抛出"
" input_error，而不是 Python 的 ValueError/TypeError。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:16
msgid "Creates a formatter and validates format."
msgstr "创建格式化器并校验 format。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:16
msgid ""
"Throws input_error for an embedded NUL, unsupported conversions, incomplete "
"formats, or more than one conversion."
msgstr "存在内嵌 NUL、不支持的转换、不完整的格式或多于一个转换时，抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:16
msgid "Formats value with the configured conversion."
msgstr "使用配置的转换格式化 value。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:16
msgid "Returns the configured format string."
msgstr "返回配置的格式字符串。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid "An owning snapshot of explicitly registered native renderer callbacks."
msgstr "显式注册的原生渲染器回调的持有型快照。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid ""
"Names are trimmed using ASCII whitespace and lowercased using ASCII rules. "
"An empty/duplicate normalized name or empty callback is rejected. The "
"snapshot does not scan plugins, import optional dependencies, or mutate a "
"process-wide registry. render passes a copied model to the callback for the "
"duration of the call; callbacks that queue work must copy that model before "
"returning. Mutable state captured by callbacks remains the caller's "
"responsibility. Built-in HTML rendering remains render_html over a "
"report_document."
msgstr ""
"名称按 ASCII 空白裁剪，并按 ASCII "
"规则转为小写。归一化后为空或重复的名称，或空回调会被拒绝。该快照不扫描插件、不导入可选依赖，也不修改进程级注册表。render "
"在调用期间将模型副本传给回调；需要排队处理工作的回调必须在返回前复制该模型。回调捕获的可变状态仍由调用方负责。内置 HTML 渲染仍是对 "
"report_document 调用 render_html。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid "Creates an immutable snapshot of the supplied renderer callbacks."
msgstr "创建所提供渲染器回调的不可变快照。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid ""
"Throws input_error for an empty normalized name, an empty callback, or names"
" that collide after trimming and ASCII lowercasing."
msgstr "归一化名称为空、回调为空，或名称在裁剪和 ASCII 小写化后冲突时，抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid "Returns the callback registered under name after name normalization."
msgstr "返回名称归一化后以 name 注册的回调。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid "Throws input_error for an empty or unknown normalized name."
msgstr "归一化名称为空或未知时抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid "Renders name with a copied model and returns its report document."
msgstr "使用模型副本渲染 name，并返回其报告文档。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:19
msgid ""
"Throws input_error for an unknown renderer; exceptions raised by the "
"callback propagate unchanged."
msgstr "渲染器未知时抛出 input_error；回调引发的异常原样传播。"

