msgstr ""
"这映射 fincore/viz/base.py（4b8f31b1b59707480d5db9603704d83bbf7e6946）中锁定的 Python"
" RenderModel 字段：returns、可选的 factor_returns 和 period。C++ 使用原生频率枚举，而不是 Python "
"的字符串约定。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:73
msgid "Creates an owning render model from the supplied frames and period."
msgstr "根据提供的帧和周期创建持有型渲染模型。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:73
msgid "Portfolio return frame."
msgstr "投资组合收益帧。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:73
msgid "Optional factor return frame."
msgstr "可选的因子收益帧。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:73
msgid "Return frequency."
msgstr "收益频率。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:76
msgid "Owning multi-series line chart data."
msgstr "持有型多序列折线图数据。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:76
msgid "Series in draw order."
msgstr "按绘制顺序排列的序列。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:76
msgid "Whether to draw a zero line."
msgstr "是否绘制零线。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:76
msgid "Whether to fill down to zero."
msgstr "是否向下填充至零。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:76
msgid "Recorded rolling window, or 0."
msgstr "记录的滚动窗口，或 0。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:79
msgid "Description of one series to copy from a frame."
msgstr "要从帧复制的一个序列的描述。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:79
msgid "Source double column name."
msgstr "源 double 列名称。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:79
msgid "Whether the series is a benchmark."
msgstr "该序列是否为基准。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:82
msgid "Builds grouped bar data from labels and row-major values."
msgstr "根据标签和行主序值构建分组柱状数据。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:82
msgid ""
"Throws input_error when either label list is empty, a label is empty, values"
" does not contain groups x series entries, or a value is non-finite."
msgstr "任一标签列表为空、某个标签为空、values 不含组数 x 序列数个条目，或某个值非有限时，抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:85
msgid "Builds a pairwise correlation matrix from double columns."
msgstr "从 double 列构建两两相关矩阵。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:85
msgid ""
"Pairs with fewer than two finite observations or zero variance remain NaN "
"with present == false. Throws input_error when no double column exists or a "
"column name is empty."
msgstr "有限观测少于两个或方差为零的配对保持 NaN，且 present == false。不存在 double 列或列名称为空时抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:88
msgid "Builds a drawdown chart with fill-to-zero enabled."
msgstr "构建启用填充至零的回撤图表。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:88
msgid "Throws input_error when the column is missing or invalid."
msgstr "列缺失或无效时抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:91
msgid "Builds chart data from an efficient frontier result."
msgstr "根据有效前沿结果构建图表数据。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:91
msgid ""
"Throws input_error when point vectors differ in length or any value or "
"marker coordinate is non-finite."
msgstr "点向量长度不同，或任一值或标记坐标非有限时，抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:94
msgid "Builds histogram bins from finite observations."
msgstr "根据有限观测构建直方图分箱。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:94
msgid ""
"Non-finite values are ignored. When all finite values are equal, the range "
"is widened by 0.5 on each side. Throws input_error when bins is zero or no "
"finite observation exists."
msgstr "非有限值被忽略。当所有有限值都相等时，范围在每侧扩大 0.5。bins 为零或不存在有限观测时抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:97
msgid "Builds a monthly percent heatmap from a return column."
msgstr "根据收益列构建月度百分比热力图。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:97
msgid ""
"The frame index must be sorted ascending and column must name a double "
"column. Months without a finite compounded value remain NaN with present == "
"false; the color range covers observed values or defaults to -10..10 when no"
" value exists. Throws input_error for invalid input."
msgstr ""
"帧索引必须按升序排序，且 column 必须指定一个 double 列。没有有限复合值的月份保持 NaN，且 present == "
"false；颜色范围覆盖观测值，若不存在值则默认为 -10..10。输入无效时抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:100
msgid "Builds the cumulative-return chart from a frame column."
msgstr "根据帧列构建累积收益图表。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:100
msgid ""
"The chart includes a zero line and uses \"Cumulative Returns\" and "
"\"Cumulative Return\" as title and axis label. Throws input_error when the "
"column is missing or invalid."
msgstr ""
"该图表包含零线，并使用 \"Cumulative Returns\" 和 \"Cumulative Return\" "
"作为标题和坐标轴标签。列缺失或无效时抛出 input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:103
msgid "Builds a rolling-Sharpe chart and records the window."
msgstr "构建滚动夏普比率图表并记录窗口。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:103
msgid ""
"When benchmark is non-null, a dashed benchmark series is read from "
"benchmark_column. Throws input_error for a missing or invalid column, an "
"empty portfolio label, or an empty benchmark label when a benchmark is "
"supplied."
msgstr ""
"benchmark 非空时，从 benchmark_column 读取虚线基准序列。列缺失或无效、投资组合标签为空，或在提供基准时基准标签为空，都会抛出"
" input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:106
msgid "Builds a line chart from named frame columns."
msgstr "根据命名帧列构建折线图。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:106
msgid ""
"Each series copies the frame index and the requested double column. A "
"benchmark series is marked benchmark and dashed. Throws input_error when "
"specs is empty, a label is empty, or a column is missing or invalid."
msgstr ""
"每个序列复制帧索引和请求的 double 列。基准序列标记为 benchmark 并使用虚线。specs 为空、标签为空，或列缺失或无效时，抛出 "
"input_error。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:109
msgid "Plots grouped bars from bar chart data."
msgstr "根据柱状图数据绘制分组柱。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:112
msgid "Plots a correlation heatmap with labelled axes."
msgstr "绘制带标签坐标轴的相关性热力图。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:115
msgid "Plots a cumulative-returns column with a date axis."
msgstr "绘制带日期轴的累积收益列。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:118
msgid "Plots a drawdown column with a date axis."
msgstr "绘制带日期轴的回撤列。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:121
msgid "Plots drawdown series as shaded areas with overlaid lines."
msgstr "将回撤序列绘制为带叠加线条的阴影区域。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:124
msgid "Plots event counts as bars over time buckets."
msgstr "将事件计数绘制为按时间分桶的柱。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:127
msgid "Plots the efficient frontier curve and its marker points."
msgstr "绘制有效前沿曲线及其标记点。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:130
msgid "Plots histogram counts over bin centers."
msgstr "绘制按分箱中心排列的直方图计数。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:133
msgid "Plots a monthly heatmap grid; empty grids are ignored."
msgstr "绘制月度热力图网格；空网格会被忽略。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:136
msgid "Plots a monthly IC heatmap with a fixed -0.2 to 0.2 color range."
msgstr "绘制固定颜色范围 -0.2 到 0.2 的月度 IC 热力图。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:139
msgid "Plots observed versus theoretical quantiles with a reference line."
msgstr "绘制观测分位数与理论分位数的对比，并带参考线。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:142
msgid "Plots cumulative quantile series by date."
msgstr "按日期绘制累积分位数序列。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:145
msgid "Plots a rolling metric column using label as title and legend."
msgstr "使用 label 作为标题和图例绘制滚动指标列。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:148
msgid "Plots every series of a line chart, including an optional zero line."
msgstr "绘制折线图的每个序列，包括可选的零线。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:151
msgid "Plots spread, rolling mean, band and zero line."
msgstr "绘制价差、滚动均值、带和零线。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:154
msgid "Plots quantile density shapes and medians per group."
msgstr "按组绘制分位数密度形状和中位数。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:157
msgid "Callback that converts a render model into a report document."
msgstr "将渲染模型转换为报告文档的回调。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:160
msgid "Renderer callbacks keyed by caller-provided name."
msgstr "以调用方提供的名称为键的渲染器回调。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:163
msgid "Headless interactive status recorded by native show entry points."
msgstr "由原生 show 入口记录的无头交互状态。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:163
msgid ""
"Native builds never open a browser or a GUI window. show returns false and "
"this constant is the documented status a caller may record instead of "
"claiming an interactive display."
msgstr "原生构建从不打开浏览器或 GUI 窗口。show 返回 false，此常量是文档中说明的状态，调用方可记录它而不声称进行了交互显示。"

#: ../../site/api/viz.md:166
msgid "English month labels used by monthly heatmap columns."
msgstr "月度热力图列使用的英文月份标签。"

